# sentence_id = 1
# translation_lang = en
# prose_translation = Since many have undertaken to compile a narrative of the events that have been fulfilled among us, just as those who from the beginning were eyewitnesses and servants of the word handed them down to us, it seemed good to me also, having followed all things closely from the start, to write to you in order, most excellent Theophilus, so that you may know the certainty of the things about which you were instructed.
# literal_translation = Inasmuch as many took in hand to compile a narrative concerning the things having been fully established among us, even as delivered to us those who from [the] beginning became eyewitnesses and servants of the word, it seemed good also to me, having followed from above to all things accurately, to write to you in order, most excellent Theophilus, in order that you might know fully concerning the words of which you were orally instructed the certainty.
